* {{ill|Tamatsuoka Shrine|ja|玉津岡神社|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Tamatsuoka Shrine|qq=}} in [[:en:Kyoto Prefecture|Kyoto Prefecture]], dedicated to her worship.
* {{ill|Himekoso Shrine|ja|比売許曽神社|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Himekoso Shrine|qq=}} in [[:en:Osaka Prefecture|Osaka Prefecture]].
